{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NoYn4HT5NrVpL4KTe8JAo1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"A stock ledger: quantities per SKU.\"\"\"\n2\t\n3\t\n4\tclass Ledger:\n5\t    def __init__(self):\n6\t        self._stock = {}\n7\t        self._history = []\n8\t\n9\t    def add(self, sku, qty):\n10\t        if qty <= 0:\n11\t            raise ValueError(\"qty to add must be positive\")\n12\t        self._stock[sku] = self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty\n13\t        self._history.append((\"add\", sku, qty))\n14\t\n15\t    def remove(self, sku, qty):\n16\t        if qty <= 0:\n17\t            raise ValueError(\"qty to remove must be positive\")\n18\t        if qty > self._stock.get(sku, 0):\n19\t            raise ValueError(\"qty to remove exceeds quantity in stock\")\n20\t        self._stock[sku] = self._stock.get(sku, 0) - qty\n21\t        self._history.append((\"remove\", sku, qty))\n22\t\n23\t    def quantity(self, sku):\n24\t        return self._stock.get(sku, 0)\n25\t\n26\t    def skus(self):\n27\t        return sorted(self._stock)\n28\t\n29\t    def history(self):\n30\t        return list(self._history)\n31\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4df0fde4-f16b-4c0c-91a1-3e3bcb7bf433","uuid":"2eee49f8-a938-4495-b177-9b6c95646a3a","timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:55:17.258Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/results/sandboxes/wip2-b6r2-rep1/rv/t2-a2-r2/stocklib/ledger.py","content":"\"\"\"A stock ledger: quantities per SKU.\"\"\"\n\n\nclass Ledger:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._stock = {}\n        self._history = []\n\n    def add(self, sku, qty):\n        if qty <= 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"qty to add must be positive\")\n        self._stock[sku] = self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty\n        self._history.append((\"add\", sku, qty))\n\n    def remove(self, sku, qty):\n        if qty <= 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"qty to remove must be positive\")\n        if qty > self._stock.get(sku, 0):\n            raise ValueError(\"qty to remove exceeds quantity in stock\")\n        self._stock[sku] = self._stock.get(sku, 0) - qty\n        self._history.append((\"remove\", sku, qty))\n\n    def quantity(self, sku):\n        return self._stock.get(sku, 0)\n\n    def skus(self):\n        return sorted(self._stock)\n\n    def history(self):\n        return list(self._history)\n","numLines":31,"startLine":1,"totalLines":31}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NoYn4HT5NrVpL4KTe8JAo1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNbYFcaKs4VBXc9iEpgB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The change does what T2 asks and nothing it forbids.\n\n- **Overdraw:** `remove` now raises `ValueError` when `qty` is greater than the stock for that SKU. An unknown SKU counts as 0 in stock, so any removal from it raises.\n- **Refusal leaves stock unchanged:** the check comes before the stock update and the history append, so a refused removal changes neither.\n- **Exact removal:** `qty == stock` passes the check, because the test is `>` rather than `>=`, and leaves 0.\n- **Scope:** only `stocklib/ledger.py` changes, and the existing `qty <= 0` check is untouched. I did not run the code or any tests.\n\nOne side effect is outside the task's wording: an unknown SKU is never inserted into `_stock` when the removal is refused. That is the behaviour you'd want.\n\nWIP-REVIEW WIP-NONCE:4c3e181c25493d49 93b8d6526227b0265b427c61a12f077e709082ac approve\n\nOPEN_FLEET_WORKER_DONE disp_73d8dba179 succeeded"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":583,"cache_read_input_tokens":18638,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":583,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":367,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4df0fde4-f16b-4c0c-91a1-3e3bcb7bf433","uuid":"9a7d4413-fba9-42a2-bc9f-ed078e82eb98","timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:55:20.842Z","request_id":"req_011CgNbYFFkKUW6ka6eft9WE"}
